  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 98791389b7d380b4395ab6a364f1847c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Navigation Categories
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Trailback.Demo.Features.Data.FeatureDemoData
  featureName: Navigation Categories
  shortDescription: Maintain independent navigation flows with configurable priorities.
  fullDescription: "Navigation Categories organize related UI elements into independent
    navigation groups.\n\nEach category maintains its own navigation history and
    configuration, allowing screens, popups, overlays, and other UI layers to behave
    independently while still participating in the same Back navigation flow.\n\nCategories
    also define how Trailback resolves navigation by controlling priority, duplicate
    handling, and root protection.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n\u2022 Independent Navigation
    Histories\n\u2022 Priority-Based Resolution\n\u2022 Configurable Duplicate Policies\n\u2022
    Root Element Protection\n\nBy separating navigation into categories, Trailback
    can resolve Back navigation predictably, even when multiple UI layers are active
    at the same time."
  screenshots: []
